        "code": {
          "text": "Headache"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports intermittent dull left-sided headache, 2–3/10, worse when overtired. Denies sudden severe headache and early-morning vomiting."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Cognitive concerns"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Daughter has said he is a bit more forgetful; patient reports misplacing items and repeating questions, but feels he has always been absent-minded. No getting lost in familiar places. Some delay recalling exact dates."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Gait and balance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling a bit wobbly, especially on first standing or in dim light, and unsteady on quick turns. Uses furniture for support indoors."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Near-fall and falls"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "One near-fall about 2 weeks ago when turning quickly in the kitchen; caught himself on a bench. No further actual falls since discharge."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
