          "text": "Instrumental activities of daily living"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Not driving as advised by hospital. Relies on daughter for shopping and transport to appointments; daughter arranged direct debit for bills, and patient is not managing complex finances himself."
      }
    },
